he 2024 report said would happen if something big enough arrived. I want to be fair to the people who read that report. They agreed with it. They minuted it. They wrote to the Ministry, and the Ministry wrote back very politely. A company director asked her board for the price of a dinner and got a raised bund instead. Denial is rarely anyone saying no. It is everyone saying yes, later. / From the archive · authored for this outcome / The run, as recorded / CONTINUE TO CHAPTER 6 / REPLAY CHAPTER / VIEW THE RIVER / CHAPTERS
